// Registry-Free Process Scope COR_PROFILER | T1574.012 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_cor_profiler.yml
powershell.file.script_block_text:*$env\:COR_ENABLE_PROFILING* AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*$env\:COR_PROFILER* AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*$env\:COR_PROFILER_PATH*
